> http://phylo.wikidot.com/per-event-weights-of-cladogenetic-range-inheritance-events-i
>
> Also study carefully table 1 of Matzke 2014:
> http://sysbio.oxfordjournals.org/content/63/6/951/T1.expansion.html
>
> Cheers!
> Nick
